// The TPM shall return TPM_RC_VALUE if:
//
// tpmKey references an RSA key and
// - the size of encryptedSalt is not the same as the size of the public modulus
//   of tpmKey,
// - encryptedSalt has a value that is greater than the public modulus of
//   tpmKey,
// - encryptedSalt is not a properly encoded OAEP value, or
// - the decrypted salt value is larger than the size of the digest produced by
//   the nameAlg of tpmKey;
//
// The asymScheme of the key object is ignored in this case and TPM_ALG_OAEP is
// used, even if asymScheme is set to TPM_ALG_NULL.
TpmTestVector(
  name: "[TPM2_StartAuthSession] tpmKey RSA bad encryptedSalt",
  spec_versions: [
    184,
  ],
  test_sequence: [
  ]
)
